    "interaction": "A screen's actual footprint protects a young neighbor from hot-phase stress while denying light to mature trees in that column. Rotating, carrying or dropping screens changes peer growth and heat exposure. One shared water cart, spring regeneration and a single carrying slot compete with planting, harvest and private/community delivery.",
